layout\\\" \\\\\\n  --type task \\\\\\n  --priority P2 \\\\\\n  --labels \\\"opencode,plugin-layout,reproducibility\\\" \\\\\\n  --assignee TrendpilotAI \\\\\\n  --description \\\"Server log ref err_97f42f88 surfaced an ENOENT against /home/mercor/.config/opencode/plugins/orca-opencode2-status on every fresh reconciliation cycle. Root cause is OpenCode 2.0.27 rejecting single-file plugin paths: the loader does a directory-package probe via stat('<name>') (no extension) and the file-only install of orca-opencode2-status.js had no companion directory. Resolved by packing it as plugins/orca-opencode2-status/index.js with the relative URL on line 1125 corrected from ./orca-opencode2-status-tui/tui.js to ../orca-opencode2-status-tui/tui.js (md5 of resolved target verified identical to source). To make this fix reproducible from the repo this issue also codifies the layout in docs/adr/0004-opencode-plugin-v2-directory-layout.md and a portable installer in scripts/install-opencode-plugins.sh that handles the legacy single-file removal, the directory package placement, and a post-install verification probe.\\\" \\\\\\n  --acceptance \\\"Plugin loads cleanly as a directory package: server log shows id='/.../orca-opencode2-status' entrypoint='/.../orca-opencode2-status/index.js' with no 'failed to load plugin' WARN line. Future plugin installations routed through scripts/install-opencode-plugins.sh produce the same layout. The internal ORCA_TUI_PLUGIN_ENTRY URL inside the plugin resolves to the existing orca-opencode2-status-tui/tui.js sibling (md5 unchanged).\\\" \\\\\\n  --notes \\\"Three other workspaces (run ids 4da1bb06, 502e2132, 797c5df9, ecfb849d) reported the same root cause; the global fix at ~/.config/opencode/plugins outlives any single workspace. The codification in this repo (ADR + script) is the durable artifact for future plugin authors.\\\" 2>&1 | tail -30\",\"timeout\":15000}","message_id":"msg_1333a98aa001RHSlv1dZ5k28v6","result":"{\"output\":{\"exit\":0,\"