{"id":"int-2b0b959bddc8b12750c8ebc7cdf46e5a","kind":"tool_call","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:57:45.405Z","actor":"opencode","tool_name":"edit","extra":{"call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-98fca97cb3e0598f","duration_ms":5,"input":"{\"path\":\"/work/mercor-work/activegraph-surrealdb/ROADMAP.md\",\"oldString\":\"- [x] Pass live isolation, rollback, native-edge, and exact-JSON tests.\\n- [ ] Pass pinned RocksDB graceful restart and abrupt container termination tests.\\n- [x] Add an in-place, data-preserving schema upgrade lane and reject a newer schema.\\n- [ ] Add a schema rollback lane before changing support.\\n- [ ] Exercise backup and clean-environment restore, then verify event integrity and replay.\\n- [ ] Record bounded performance observations on controlled, representative data.\",\"newString\":\"- [x] Pass live isolation, rollback, native-edge, and exact-JSON tests.\\n- [ ] Pass pinned RocksDB graceful restart and abrupt container termination tests.\\n- [x] Add an in-place, data-preserving schema upgrade lane and reject a newer schema.\\n- [x] Add a schema rollback lane before changing support.\\n- [x] Exercise backup and clean-environment restore, then verify event integrity and replay.\\n- [ ] Record bounded performance observations on controlled, representative data.\"}","message_id":"msg_13331c35a001eTc2JpPpUGUAC7","result":"{\"output\":{\"files\":[{\"file\":\"ROADMAP.md\",\"patch\":\"Index: ROADMAP.md\\n===================================================================\\n--- ROADMAP.md\\n+++ ROADMAP.md\\n@@ -25,10 +25,10 @@\\n \\n - [x] Pass live isolation, rollback, native-edge, and exact-JSON tests.\\n - [ ] Pass pinned RocksDB graceful restart and abrupt container termination tests.\\n - [x] Add an in-place, data-preserving schema upgrade lane and reject a newer schema.\\n-- [ ] Add a schema rollback lane before changing support.\\n-- [ ] Exercise backup and clean-environment restore, then verify event integrity and replay.\\n+- [x] Add a schema rollback lane before changing support.\\n+- [x] Exercise backup and clean-environment restore, then verify event integrity and replay.\\n - [ ] Record bounded performance observations on controlled, representative data.\\n \\n ## Phase 3 — Upstream lifecycle alignment\\n \\n\",\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":2,\"status\":\"modified\"}],\"replacements\":1},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Edited ROADMAP.md (1 replacement)\"}],\"metadata\":{\"files\":[{\"file\":\"ROADMAP.md\",\"patch\":\"Index: ROADMAP.md\\n===================================================================\\n--- ROADMAP.md\\n+++ ROADMAP.md\\n@@ -25,10 +25,10 @@\\n \\n - [x] Pass live isolation, rollback, native-edge, and exact-JSON tests.\\n - [ ] Pass pinned RocksDB graceful restart and abrupt container termination tests.\\n - [x] Add an in-place, data-preserving schema upgrade lane and reject a newer schema.\\n-- [ ] Add a schema rollback lane before changing support.\\n-- [ ] Exercise backup and clean-environment restore, then verify event integrity and replay.\\n+- [x] Add a schema rollback lane before changing support.\\n+- [x] Exercise backup and clean-environment restore, then verify event integrity and replay.\\n - [ ] Record bounded performance observations on controlled, representative data.\\n \\n ## Phase 3 — Upstream lifecycle alignment\\n \\n\",\"status\":\"modified\",\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":2}]}}","session_id":"ses_ecce71390ffe11p6yPgte61c3p","status":"completed"}}
{"id":"int-7f2f404524943c16f8c963e6d9c6634c","kind":"tool_call","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:57:50.07Z","actor":"opencode","tool_name":"edit","extra":{"call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9215fbeab1addc4a","duration_ms":3,"input":"{\"path\":\"/work/mercor-work/activegraph-surrealdb/docs/adr/0003-native-query-pushdown.md\",\"oldString\":\"`tests/integration/test_graph_pushdown.py` disables `all_objects` and\\n`all_relations` and then exercises every overridden hook. A regression to the\\nPython fallback raises instead of returning rows. The released\\n`GraphStoreConformance` suite runs unchanged against the same store, so the\\npushed-down behavior is pinned to the canonical semantics.\",\"newString\":\"`tests/integration/test_graph_pushdown.py` disables `all_objects` and\\n`all_relations` and then exercises every overridden hook. A regression to the\\nPython fallback raises instead of returning rows. The released\\n`GraphStoreConformance` suite runs unchanged against the same store, so the\\npushed-down behavior is pinned to the canonical semantics.\\n\\n## Evidence\\n\\nAccepted on the strength of the 2026-10-13 evidence-ladder runs (SurrealDB\\n`3.2.4`, native server lane per the recorded sandbox deviation, `agvm-8ii`):\\n\\n- `pytest -m surrealdb tests/integration` — 74 passed on server-side RocksDB\\n  (`ws://`) and again over the TLS lane (`wss://` with enforced certificate\\n  verification), including `test_graph_pushdown.py` with the Python fallback\\n  disabled.\\n- 74 passed on a dedicated SurrealKV volume (V7 lane, beta evidence).\\n- Unit/contract ladder: 28 passed, 2 xfail (upstream #81/#82).\\n\\nThe load-bearing `1.12.0` pin and the residual-predicate contract are re-proven\\non every one of those runs by the released conformance suites.\"}","message_id":"msg_13331d27b001FY60Q5iO5PNfAH","result":"{\"output\":{\"files\":[{\"file\":\"docs/adr/0003-native-query-pushdown.md\",\"patch\":\"Index: docs/adr/0003-native-query-pushdown.md\\n===================================================================\\n--- docs/adr/0003-native-query-pushdown.md\\n+++ docs/adr/0003-native-query-pushdown.md\\n@@ -65,4 +65,19 @@\\n `all_relations` and then exercises every overridden hook. A regression to the\\n Python fallback raises instead of returning rows. The released\\n `GraphStoreConformance` suite runs unchanged against the same store, so the\\n pushed-down behavior is pinned to the canonical semantics.\\n+\\n+## Evidence\\n+\\n+Accepted on the strength of the 2026-10-13 evidence-ladder runs (SurrealDB\\n+`3.2.4`, native server lane per the recorded sandbox deviation, `agvm-8ii`):\\n+\\n+- `pytest -m surrealdb tests/integration` — 74 passed on server-side RocksDB\\n+  (`ws://`) and again over the TLS lane (`wss://` with enforced certificate\\n+  verification), including `test_graph_pushdown.py` with the Python fallback\\n+  disabled.\\n+- 74 passed on a dedicated SurrealKV volume (V7 lane, beta evidence).\\n+- Unit/contract ladder: 28 passed, 2 xfail (upstream #81/#82).\\n+\\n+The load-bearing `1.12.0` pin and the residual-predicate contract are re-proven\\n+on every one of those runs by the released conformance suites.\\n\",\"additions\":15,\"deletions\":0,\"status\":\"modified\"}],\"replacements\":1},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Edited docs/adr/0003-native-query-pushdown.md (1 replacement)\"}],\"metadata\":{\"files\":[{\"file\":\"docs/adr/0003-native-query-pushdown.md\",\"patch\":\"Index: docs/adr/0003-native-query-pushdown.md\\n===================================================================\\n--- docs/adr/0003-native-query-pushdown.md\\n+++ docs/adr/0003-native-query-pushdown.md\\n@@ -65,4 +65,19 @@\\n `all_relations` and then exercises every overridden hook. A regression to the\\n Python fallback raises instead of returning rows. The released\\n `GraphStoreConformance` suite runs unchanged against the same store, so the\\n pushed-down behavior is pinned to the canonical semantics.\\n+\\n+## Evidence\\n+\\n+Accepted on the strength of the 2026-10-13 evidence-ladder runs (SurrealDB\\n+`3.2.4`, native server lane per the recorded sandbox deviation, `agvm-8ii`):\\n+\\n+- `pytest -m surrealdb tests/integration` — 74 passed on server-side RocksDB\\n+  (`ws://`) and again over the TLS lane (`wss://` with enforced certificate\\n+  verification), including `test_graph_pushdown.py` with the Python fallback\\n+  disabled.\\n+- 74 passed on a dedicated SurrealKV volume (V7 lane, beta evidence).\\n+- Unit/contract ladder: 28 passed, 2 xfail (upstream #81/#82).\\n+\\n+The load-bearing `1.12.0` pin and the residual-predicate contract are re-proven\\n+on every one of those runs by the released conformance suites.\\n\",\"status\":\"modified\",\"additions\":15,\"deletions\":0}]}}","session_id":"ses_ecce71390ffe11p6yPgte61c3p","status":"completed"}}
