{"id":"int-9c0627e0ea67b1d51dfb161c0cd75a99","kind":"tool_call","created_at":"2026-10-13T03:05:10.937Z","actor":"opencode","tool_name":"shell","extra":{"call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6aaeef75c5c9b26","duration_ms":1049,"input":"{\"command\":\"gh pr view 12 2>&1 | head -60\"}","message_id":"msg_133388dc9001gtL1g5LI7tbruF","result":"{\"output\":{\"exit\":0,\"truncated\":false,\"output\":\"title:\\tdocs: record lane evidence and accept ADR 0003 (V6/V7/V8/V9)\\nstate:\\tOPEN\\nauthor:\\tTrendpilotAI (Nathan Stevenson)\\nlabels:\\t\\nassignees:\\t\\nreviewers:\\tchatgpt-codex-connector (Commented)\\nprojects:\\t\\nmilestone:\\t\\nnumber:\\t12\\nurl:\\thttps://github.com/TrendpilotAI/activegraph-surrealdb/pull/12\\nadditions:\\t230\\ndeletions:\\t17\\nauto-merge:\\tdisabled\\n--\\n## Summary\\n\\nCompletes the remaining native-feasible evidence-ladder lanes (V6, V7, V8, V9) on top of the V1/V2/V4/V5 checkpoint already on `main`.\\n\\n## Lanes\\n\\n| Lane | Bead | Result |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| V6 TLS (Lane A) | agvm-has | ✅ local CA via openssl, native `surreal v3.2.4` with `--web-crt/--web-key` on fresh rocksdb volume; `surreal is-ready` over `https://` OK; full suite over `wss://` with certificate verification: **74 passed** (16.5s) |\\n| V7 surrealkv (Lane C) | agvm-ral | ✅ dedicated `surrealkv:///` volume, fresh server; full suite: **74 passed** (16.0s) — recorded as beta evidence |\\n| V8 embedded (Lane D) | agvm-kj8 | ✅ isolated `.venv-embedded` with `surrealdb[embedded]==3.0.0b10`; new `tests/embedded/` lane (marker + gate conftest, selected-but-skipped without `ACTIVEGRAPH_SURREALDB_EMBEDDED=1`): **5 passed** — SDK variant asserted, embedded transports still rejected (`ConfigurationError: ws:// or wss://`) |\\n| V9 gates + docs | agvm-d0q | ✅ ruff check/format green, mypy strict green, `python -m build` + `twine check` **PASSED** (sdist excludes for lane venvs), unit suite 28 passed / 2 xfail; ROADMAP Phase 2 rollback + backup boxes checked; compatibility matrix updated; ADR 0003 evidence section appended |\\n\\n## Deviations (approved policy)\\n\\nAll lanes ran against the **native `surreal v3.2.4` binary** on fresh per-lane volumes — the container-runtime sandbox cannot start containers (devpts `gid=5` unmappable; `agvm-8ii`) and `api.modal.com` is egress-blocked. Compose-topology fidelity and the V3 qualification (restart/kill sequences) remain deferred to a VM-runtime sandbox.\\n\\n## Test plan\\n- [x] `pytest -m 'not surrealdb and not qualification and not embedded'` — 28 passed, 2 xfailed\\n- [x] `pytest -m surrealdb tests/integration` over `wss://` (TLS) — 74 passed\\n- [x] `pytest -m surrealdb tests/integration` on surrealkv — 74 passed\\n- [x] `ACTIVEGRAPH_SURREALDB_EMBEDDED=1 pytest tests/embedded -m embedded` — 5 passed\\n- [x] `ruff check && ruff format --check && mypy && python -m build && twine check dist/*`\\n\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\\n\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"title:\\tdocs: record lane evidence and accept ADR 0003 (V6/V7/V8/V9)\\nstate:\\tOPEN\\nauthor:\\tTrendpilotAI (Nathan Stevenson)\\nlabels:\\t\\nassignees:\\t\\nreviewers:\\tchatgpt-codex-connector (Commented)\\nprojects:\\t\\nmilestone:\\t\\nnumber:\\t12\\nurl:\\thttps://github.com/TrendpilotAI/activegraph-surrealdb/pull/12\\nadditions:\\t230\\ndeletions:\\t17\\nauto-merge:\\tdisabled\\n--\\n## Summary\\n\\nCompletes the remaining native-feasible evidence-ladder lanes (V6, V7, V8, V9) on top of the V1/V2/V4/V5 checkpoint already on `main`.\\n\\n## Lanes\\n\\n| Lane | Bead | Result |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| V6 TLS (Lane A) | agvm-has | ✅ local CA via openssl, native `surreal v3.2.4` with `--web-crt/--web-key` on fresh rocksdb volume; `surreal is-ready` over `https://` OK; full suite over `wss://` with certificate verification: **74 passed** (16.5s) |\\n| V7 surrealkv (Lane C) | agvm-ral | ✅ dedicated `surrealkv:///` volume, fresh server; full suite: **74 passed** (16.0s) — recorded as beta evidence |\\n| V8 embedded (Lane D) | agvm-kj8 | ✅ isolated `.venv-embedded` with `surrealdb[embedded]==3.0.0b10`; new `tests/embedded/` lane (marker + gate conftest, selected-but-skipped without `ACTIVEGRAPH_SURREALDB_EMBEDDED=1`): **5 passed** — SDK variant asserted, embedded transports still rejected (`ConfigurationError: ws:// or wss://`) |\\n| V9 gates + docs | agvm-d0q | ✅ ruff check/format green, mypy strict green, `python -m build` + `twine check` **PASSED** (sdist excludes for lane venvs), unit suite 28 passed / 2 xfail; ROADMAP Phase 2 rollback + backup boxes checked; compatibility matrix updated; ADR 0003 evidence section appended |\\n\\n## Deviations (approved policy)\\n\\nAll lanes ran against the **native `surreal v3.2.4` binary** on fresh per-lane volumes — the container-runtime sandbox cannot start containers (devpts `gid=5` unmappable; `agvm-8ii`) and `api.modal.com` is egress-blocked. Compose-topology fidelity and the V3 qualification (restart/kill sequences) remain deferred to a VM-runtime sandbox.\\n\\n## Test plan\\n- [x] `pytest -m 'not surrealdb and not qualification and not embedded'` — 28 passed, 2 xfailed\\n- [x] `pytest -m surrealdb tests/integration` over `wss://` (TLS) — 74 passed\\n- [x] `pytest -m surrealdb tests/integration` on surrealkv — 74 passed\\n- [x] `ACTIVEGRAPH_SURREALDB_EMBEDDED=1 pytest tests/embedded -m embedded` — 5 passed\\n- [x] `ruff check && ruff format --check && mypy && python -m build && twine check dist/*`\\n\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\\n\"}],\"metadata\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"truncated\":false,\"exit\":0}}","session_id":"ses_ecce71390ffe11p6yPgte61c3p","status":"completed"}}
