ory package placement, and a post-install verification probe.         \\n\\n\\n\\nNOTES\\n\\n  Three other workspaces (run ids 4da1bb06, 502e2132, 797c5df9, ecfb849d)     \\n  reported the same root cause; the global fix at ~/.config/opencode/plugins  \\n  outlives any single workspace. The codification in this repo (ADR + script) \\n  is the durable artifact for future plugin authors.                          \\n\\n\\n\\nACCEPTANCE CRITERIA\\n\\n  Plugin loads cleanly as a directory package: server log shows id='/.../orca-\\n  opencode2-status' entrypoint='/.../orca-opencode2-status/index.js' with no  \\n  'failed to load plugin' WARN line. Future plugin installations routed       \\n  through scripts/install-opencode-plugins.sh produce the same layout. The    \\n  internal ORCA_TUI_PLUGIN_ENTRY URL inside the plugin resolves to the        \\n  existing orca-opencode2-status-tui/tui.js sibling (md5 unchanged).          \\n\\n\"}],\"metadata\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"truncated\":false,\"exit\":0}}","session_id":"ses_eccd12d4cffe3Dd6d2N0q7gQQs","status":"completed"}}
