'.[dev]', record py.typed status, compose down + remove old dev volume\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"docs/upgrade-plan.md ladder step V0. Serialized ladder; each step holds the environment token.\\\",\\\"notes\\\":\\\"V0 evidence (2026-10-13, Modal sandbox mercor-vm):\\\\n1. Manifest check: docker CLI ABSENT in sandbox; verified equivalently via registry API — surrealdb/surrealdb:v3.3.0 resolves to OCI index (linux/amd64 sha256:1b62edce…, linux/arm64 sha256:089a93b0…). PASS (equivalent means).\\\\n2. Fresh .venv: python 3.12.10, pip install -e '.[dev]' exit 0; activegraph 1.12.0 + surrealdb 2.0.0 installed per pins. PASS.\\\\n3. py.typed: ABSENT in installed activegraph 1.12.0 wheel — confirms the mypy override comment in pyproject.toml (line 59). PASS (recorded).\\\\n4. compose down + old dev volume removal: NOT EXECUTABLE — no docker daemon/CLI/socket/podman in sandbox; no containers or volumes exist (fresh VM), so environment is clean by construction. DEVIATION recorded; docker capability tracked separately as blocker for V2+.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"closed\\\",\\\"priority\\\":1,\\\"issue_type\\\":\\\"task\\\",\\\"assignee\\\":\\\"TrendpilotAI\\\",\\\"owner\\\":\\\"trendpilot.ai@pm.me\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-13T01:33:08Z\\\",\\\"created_by\\\":\\\"TrendpilotAI\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-13T02:01:21Z\\\",\\\"started_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-13T02:00:03Z\\\",\\\"closed_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-13T02:01:21Z\\\",\\\"close_reason\\\":\\\"V0 complete with recorded deviation: manifest verified via registry API (docker CLI absent), fresh .venv green (activegraph 1.12.0, surrealdb 2.0.0, py3.12.10), py.typed confirmed absent. compose-down step vacuous (no docker in sandbox; clean by construction). Docker gap tracked for V2+.\\\",\\\"dependency_count\\\":0,\\\"dependent_count\\\":1,\\\"comment_count\\\":0}\\n{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"issue\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"agvm-76z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Resolve orca-opencode2-status plugin load failure (err_97f42f88) and codify the OpenCode 2 directory-package layout\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Server log ref err_97f42f88 surfaced an ENOENT against /home/mercor/.config/opencode/plugins/orca-opencode2-status on every fresh reconciliation cycle. Root cause is OpenCode 2.0.27 rejecting single-file plugin paths: the loader does a directory-package probe via stat('\\\\u003cname\\\\u003e') (no extension) and the file-only install of orca-opencode2-status.js had no companion directory. Resolved by packing it as plugins/orca-opencode2-status/index.js with the relative URL on line 1125 corrected from ./orca-opencode2-status-tui/tui.js to ../orca-opencode2-status-tui/tui.js (md5 of resolved target verified identical to source). To make this fix reproducible from the repo this issue also codifies the layout in docs/adr/0004-opencode-plugin-v2-directory-layout.md and a portable installer in scripts/install-opencode-plugins.sh that handles the legacy single-file removal, the directory package placement, and a post-install verification probe.\\\",\\\"acceptance_criteria\\\":\\\"Plugin loads cleanly as a directory package: server log shows id='/.../orca-opencode2-status' entrypoint='/.../orca-opencode2-status/index.js' with no 'failed to load plugin' WARN line. Future plugin installations routed through scripts/install-opencode-plugins.sh produce the same layout. The internal ORCA_TUI_PLUGIN_ENTRY URL inside the plugin resolves to the existing orca-opencode2-status-tui/tui.js sibling (md5 unchanged).\\\",\\\"notes\\\":\\\"Three other workspaces (run ids 4da1bb06, 502e2132, 797c5df9, ecfb849d) reported the same root cause; the global fix at ~/.config/opencode/plugins outlives any single workspace. The codification in this repo (ADR + script) is the durable artifact for future plugin authors.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"open\\\",\\\"priority\\\":2,\\\"issue_type\\\":\\\"task\\\",\\\"assignee\\\":\\\"TrendpilotAI\\\",\\\"owner\\\":\\\"trendpilot.ai@pm.me\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-13T03:07:34Z\\\",\\\"created_by\\\