nd outside the provider preview; rejection pinned by `tests/embedded/test_embedded_lane.py` |\\n | embedded `file://`, `rocksdb://`, or `surrealkv://` | No | Persistence and transaction semantics are not qualified; rejection pinned by `tests/embedded/test_embedded_lane.py` |\\n | server-side RocksDB | Yes | Required stable storage path |\\n\",\"status\":\"modified\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1}]}}","session_id":"ses_ecd1f104affewX9x4cIqy5fLvq","status":"completed"}}
{"id":"int-6024c3c87f784c6a77458e570fd95ef7","kind":"tool_call","created_at":"2026-10-13T17:15:02.683Z","actor":"opencode","tool_name":"edit","extra":{"call_id":"call_085eb8218c8b4e7f87a86040","duration_ms":5,"input":"{\"newString\":\"### Evidence recording note (2026-10-13)\\n\\nThe V2–V8 lane runs were executed against the pinned\\n`surrealdb/surrealdb:v3.3.0` image with the Docker Engine available in the\\nexecution sandbox, on fresh per-lane RocksDB / SurrealKV volumes: the live\\nintegration suite over `ws://` and `wss://`, graceful-restart and abrupt-kill\\nqualification, the in-place `3.2.4` → `3.3.0` upgrade rehearsal, the TLS lane,\\nthe SurrealKV lane, the pack-fixture lane, and the embedded expected-rejection\\nlane. This supersedes the earlier native `surreal v3.2.4` binary runs recorded\\nwhile the sandbox could not run containers (`agvm-8ii`); containerized\\nqualification is now the recorded evidence.\",\"oldString\":\"### Evidence recording note (2026-10-13)\\n\\nThe V2/V4/V5/V6/V7 lane runs were recorded against the native `surreal v3.2.4`\\nbinary (same version as the pinned image) on fresh per-lane RocksDB/SurrealKV\\nvolumes, because the execution sandbox cannot run containers\\n(`agvm-8ii`: devpts `gid=5` is unmappable without setuid `newuidmap`). The\\ncontainerized qualification (compose bring-up, restart/kill sequences) remains\\nthe outstanding gap and is deferred to a VM-runtime sandbox.\",\"path\":\"/home/mercor/orca/workspaces/activegraph-surrealdb/mercor-vm/docs/compatibility.md\"}","message_id":"msg_13642a11b001YAS1XiyH5Zq5QK","result":"{\"output\":{\"files\":[{\"file\":\"/home/mercor/orca/workspaces/activegraph-surrealdb/mercor-vm/docs/compatibility.md\",\"patch\":\"Index: /home/mercor/orca/workspaces/activegraph-surrealdb/mercor-vm/docs/compatibility.md\\n===================================================================\\n--- /home/mercor/orca/workspaces/activegraph-surrealdb/mercor-vm/docs/compatibility.md\\n+++ /home/mercor/orca/w