{"id":"int-990ae3818898b0fe008edf4e886808a1","kind":"tool_call","created_at":"2026-10-13T22:39:15.347Z","actor":"opencode","tool_name":"read","extra":{"call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b474d2374c54672a","duration_ms":18,"input":"{\"limit\":30,\"offset\":140,\"path\":\"/work/mercor-work/activegraph-surrealdb/AGENTS.md\"}","message_id":"msg_1376b7c8d001C75Cn1pfo6HlyF","result":"{\"output\":{\"type\":\"text-page\",\"content\":\"Python ≥3.11. Fresh environment:\\n\\n```bash\\npython -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install -e '.[dev]'\\n```\\n\\nTest ladder (see docs/upgrade-plan.md for the serialized evidence ladder V0–V9):\\n\\n```bash\\n# Unit (no server needed)\\npytest -m 'not surrealdb and not qualification'\\n\\n# Live integration (needs a running server)\\ndocker compose up -d\\npytest -m surrealdb tests/integration\\n\\n# Qualification (controls a pinned Docker server; restart/kill sequences)\\nACTIVEGRAPH_SURREALDB_QUALIFY=1 pytest -m qualification tests/qualification\\n\\n# Published evidence example\\npython examples/replay_fork_diff.py\\n```\\n\\nQuality gates (all must pass before a commit is accepted):\\n\\n```bash\\nruff check && ruff format --check && mypy\\npython -m build && twine check dist/*\\n```\\n\",\"mime\":\"text/markdown\",\"offset\":140,\"truncated\":true,\"next\":170},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Read file /work/mercor-work/activegraph-surrealdb/AGENTS.md, lines 140-169\\n140: Python ≥3.11. Fresh environment:\\n141: \\n142: ```bash\\n143: python -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install -e '.[dev]'\\n144: ```\\n145: \\n146: Test ladder (see docs/upgrade-plan.md for the serialized evidence ladder V0–V9):\\n147: \\n148: ```bash\\n149: # Unit (no server needed)\\n150: pytest -m 'not surrealdb and not qualification'\\n151: \\n152: # Live integration (needs a running server)\\n153: docker compose up -d\\n154: pytest -m surrealdb tests/integration\\n155: \\n156: # Qualification (controls a pinned Docker server; restart/kill sequences)\\n157: ACTIVEGRAPH_SURREALDB_QUALIFY=1 pytest -m qualification tests/qualification\\n158: \\n159: # Published evidence example\\n160: python examples/replay_fork_diff.py\\n161: ```\\n162: \\n163: Quality gates (all must pass before a commit is accepted):\\n164: \\n165: ```bash\\n166: ruff check && ruff format --check && mypy\\n167: python -m build && twine check dist/*\\n168: ```\\n169: \\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 170]\"}],\"metadata\":{\"truncated\":true}}","session_id":"ses_ecce71390ffe11p6yPgte61c3p","status":"completed"}}
