{"id":"int-e182c878cad453ee7ce63d541d2a6a79","kind":"tool_call","created_at":"2026-10-13T22:39:55.118Z","actor":"opencode","tool_name":"shell","extra":{"call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b812ad2595ae7f13","duration_ms":44,"input":"{\"command\":\"python3 - <<'EOF'\\nimport re\\np = 'docs/upgrade-plan.md'\\ns = open(p).read()\\n\\n# Fix dangling ADR pointer (renamed from the draft name to the pushdown ADR)\\ns = s.replace('[ADR 0003](adr/0003-latest-stable-pins-and-exploration-lanes.md)',\\n              '[ADR 0003](adr/0003-native-query-pushdown.md)')\\n\\n# Status header: executed\\ns = s.replace('- Status: planned; not started\\\\n- Date: 2026-10-12\\\\n',\\n              '- Status: executed 2026-10-13 (see Outcome below; results recorded in beads and [compatibility](compatibility.md))\\\\n- Date: 2026-10-12\\\\n')\\n\\n# Insert outcome section after the header block\\noutcome = '''## Outcome (recorded 2026-10-13)\\n\\nThe ladder ran to V9 on branch `agentic/ladder-native-evidence` (merged through\\n`main`) and `agentic/ladder-v6-v9` (PR 12). Deviation: the execution sandbox\\ncannot run containers (`agvm-8ii`), so every server lane ran against the native\\n`surreal v3.2.4` binary on fresh per-lane volumes instead of the Compose\\nservice — approved as lane evidence with a documented deviation. The plan's\\nfallback to `v3.2.5` was never triggered; the server pin stays `v3.2.4` and\\n`3.3.x` remains a preview lane.\\n\\n| Step | Result | Evidence |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| V0 pre-flight | complete with deviations | manifest via registry API; fresh `.venv` green; `py.typed` absent (mypy overrides kept); compose steps vacuous (`agvm-llp`) |\\n| V1 unit | green | 28 passed, 2 xfail (upstream #81/#82) (`agvm-puj`) |\\n| V2 live integration | green with deviation | 74 passed on server-side RocksDB (`agvm-0qc`) |\\n| V3 qualification | **blocked** | container restart/kill needs Docker; deferred to a VM-runtime sandbox (`agvm-5am`) |\\n| V4 example | green with deviation | `replay_fork_diff.py` trace completed (`agvm-16y`) |\\n| V5 upgrade lane | green with deviation | `test_schema_upgrade.py` + new `test_backup_restore.py` (export, clean restore, integrity, rollback rejection) (`agvm-c6k`) |\\n| V6 TLS lane | green with deviation | local openssl CA; `--web-crt`/`--web-key`; full suite over `wss://` (74 passed) (`agvm-has`) |\\n| V7 surrealkv lane | green with deviation | dedicated `surrealkv:///` volume; 74 passed; beta evidence (`agvm-ral`) |\\n| V8 embedded lane | green with deviation | `.venv-embedded` + `surrealdb[embedded]==3.0.0b10`; `tests/embedded/` pins expected rejections (5 passed) (`agvm-kj8`) |\\n| V9 records | complete | ruff/mypy/build/twine green; ADR 0003 accepted with evidence; matrix and ROADMAP updated (`agvm-d0q`) |\\n\\nOpen items: V3 qualification (Docker-dependent) and the bounded performance\\nobservations (Phase 2) remain undone; the WP1 `v3.3.0` re-pin did **not** occur\\n— the compatibility-first gate keeps `v3.2.4` pinned until a `3.3.0`\\ncompatibility branch passes the same ladder.\\n\\n## Purpose and swarm model\\n'''\\ns = s.replace('## Purpose and swarm model\\\\n', outcome, 1)\\nopen(p, 'w').write(s)\\nprint('patched')\\nEOF\\nsed -n '1,20p' docs/upgrade-plan.md\"}","message_id":"msg_1376c03e00019bnbFh8YgQtIKV","result":"{\"output\":{\"exit\":0,\"truncated\":false,\"output\":\"patched\\n# Upgrade plan: latest-stable pins and exploration lanes\\n\\n- Status: executed 2026-10-13 (see Outcome below; results recorded in beads and [compatibility](compatibility.md))\\n- Date: 2026-10-12\\n- Decision record: [ADR 0003](adr/0003-native-query-pushdown.md)\\n- Branch: `non-agentic/graph-db-upgrades`\\n- Execution model: one coordinating session plus a sub-agent swarm\\n\\n## Outcome (recorded 2026-10-13)\\n\\nThe ladder ran to V9 on branch `agentic/ladder-native-evidence` (merged through\\n`main`) and `agentic/ladder-v6-v9` (PR 12). Deviation: the execution sandbox\\ncannot run containers (`agvm-8ii`), so every server lane ran against the native\\n`surreal v3.2.4` binary on fresh per-lane volumes instead of the Compose\\nservice — approved as lane evidence with a documented deviation. The plan's\\nfallback to `v3.2.5` was never triggered; the server pin stays `v3.2.4` and\\n`3.3.x` remains a preview lane.\\n\\n| Step | Result | Evidence |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"patched\\n# Upgrade plan: latest-stable pins and exploration lanes\\n\\n- Status: executed 2026-10-13 (see Outcome below; results recorded in beads and [compatibility](compatibility.md))\\n- Date: 2026-10-12\\n- Decision record: [ADR 0003](adr/0003-native-query-pushdown.md)\\n- Branch: `non-agentic/graph-db-upgrades`\\n- Execution model: one coordinating session plus a sub-agent swarm\\n\\n## Outcome (recorded 2026-10-13)\\n\\nThe ladder ran to V9 on branch `agentic/ladder-native-evidence` (merged through\\n`main`) and `agentic/ladder-v6-v9` (PR 12). Deviation: the execution sandbox\\ncannot run containers (`agvm-8ii`), so every server lane ran against the native\\n`surreal v3.2.4` binary on fresh per-lane volumes instead of the Compose\\nservice — approved as lane evidence with a documented deviation. The plan's\\nfallback to `v3.2.5` was never triggered; the server pin stays `v3.2.4` and\\n`3.3.x` remains a preview lane.\\n\\n| Step | Result | Evidence |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n\"}],\"metadata\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"truncated\":false,\"exit\":0}}","session_id":"ses_ecce71390ffe11p6yPgte61c3p","status":"completed"}}
